  -1 does not fit UInt8
  expected by a/a.canon:3 (y: UInt8)

error[E3201]  a/a.canon:23:52
  256 does not fit UInt8
  expected by a/a.canon:3 (x: UInt8)

error[E3201]  a/a.canon:25:28
  200 does not fit Int8
